WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.637
- My boyfriend's lactose
intolerant and it was like an issue

00:00:02.637 --> 00:00:04.068
for awhile, but we worked through it

00:00:04.068 --> 00:00:05.711
and we're stronger because of it.

00:00:05.711 --> 00:00:06.919
- That sounds messy.

00:00:06.919 --> 00:00:10.002
(funky upbeat music)

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:12.686
- Okay, what's up you guys?

00:00:12.686 --> 00:00:13.979
So, earlier this week, Burger King

00:00:13.979 --> 00:00:15.509
released their Lucky Charms milkshake.

00:00:15.509 --> 00:00:17.983
So inevitably, it's time
for me to go uptown,

00:00:17.983 --> 00:00:19.602
snag a bunch of Lucky Charms milkshakes

00:00:19.602 --> 00:00:21.610
and make my coworkers try
them out and see how they are.

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:22.651
Let's do it.

00:00:22.651 --> 00:00:25.734
(funky upbeat music)

00:00:29.782 --> 00:00:32.463
- Hey, can I get four of the
Lucky Charms milkshakes please?

00:00:32.463 --> 00:00:35.546
(funky upbeat music)

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:40.465
- I love milkshakes.

00:00:40.465 --> 00:00:41.590
I love milkshakes so much

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:43.044
I could have a milkshake every day.

00:00:43.044 --> 00:00:45.156
I'm also super lactose intolerant.

00:00:45.156 --> 00:00:46.819
- I like milkshakes, sure.

00:00:46.819 --> 00:00:48.678
- I'm a huge milkshake fan.

00:00:48.678 --> 00:00:51.970
- I love Burger King, I
love fast food burgers,

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:54.085
I like food that's not good for me.

00:00:54.085 --> 00:00:55.474
- I love Burger King.

00:00:55.474 --> 00:00:59.762
- I haven't eaten Burger
King since I was like 14.

00:00:59.762 --> 00:01:02.914
- The ambience, the
smell, the chicken fries.

00:01:02.914 --> 00:01:04.276
- I like Lucky Charms.

00:01:04.276 --> 00:01:06.160
I'm in it more for the marshmallows.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.866
- You know, yeah, I'm
pregnant, I get cravings.

00:01:08.866 --> 00:01:10.582
Lucky Charms is in that category.

00:01:10.582 --> 00:01:12.416
- Did you know there was
a Lucky Charms milkshake?

00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:13.249
- No.

00:01:13.249 --> 00:01:15.897
- If this were not tasty,
I would be floored.

00:01:15.897 --> 00:01:18.733
- If it's soggy cereal in
a milkshake, tappin' out.

00:01:18.733 --> 00:01:21.790
- I feel like it's
gonna be a lot of sugar.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:23.258
- I see it, can we have it?

00:01:23.258 --> 00:01:25.814
- We are excited, let's
just do this, let's do it.

00:01:25.814 --> 00:01:27.242
- It looks like Funfetti milkshake.

00:01:27.242 --> 00:01:28.200
- That's what it looks like.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.297
- Looks like a party in a cup.

00:01:29.297 --> 00:01:32.000
- But you can see like a nice
little rainbow around the top.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.475
- I thought there would be more color.

00:01:33.475 --> 00:01:36.413
- That smells like the frosting
you get out of the can.

00:01:36.413 --> 00:01:37.542
- You know, they should've topped it

00:01:37.542 --> 00:01:40.005
with marshmallows.
- Yeah.

00:01:40.005 --> 00:01:42.336
- It's so thick.
(laughter)

00:01:42.336 --> 00:01:44.003
- It's like if you put heavy cream

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.501
in your cereal every morning.

00:01:46.501 --> 00:01:48.109
- Wow.

00:01:48.109 --> 00:01:51.388
- I'm not seeing four-leaf clovers,

00:01:51.388 --> 00:01:54.138
rainbows, balloons, pots of gold.

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:57.429
- Whoa!

00:01:57.429 --> 00:01:58.895
- This thing is super good.

00:01:58.895 --> 00:02:00.975
- Wait, can I have some more, thank you.

00:02:00.975 --> 00:02:02.466
- Do we know how much sugar is in this?

00:02:02.466 --> 00:02:03.401
(record scratching)

00:02:03.401 --> 00:02:04.312
(funky upbeat music)

00:02:04.312 --> 00:02:06.619
I don't think I want to know
how much sugar is in this

00:02:06.619 --> 00:02:09.539
because I wanta enjoy it and not know.

00:02:09.539 --> 00:02:11.577
- They should do Cinnamon Toast Crunch.

00:02:11.577 --> 00:02:14.261
Honestly, 'cause that's the best cereal.

00:02:14.261 --> 00:02:15.425
Cinnamon Toast Crunch.

00:02:15.425 --> 00:02:18.119
- I would actually spend
my own money on this,

00:02:18.119 --> 00:02:19.581
but thank you BuzzFeed. (laughs)

00:02:19.581 --> 00:02:21.155
- I would say definitely go try this.

00:02:21.155 --> 00:02:23.343
Share it with a friend
so you stop yourself

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:24.596
from drinking the whole thing.

00:02:24.596 --> 00:02:25.535
- If there was a Burger King

00:02:25.535 --> 00:02:27.601
near where I lived, I'd get this.

00:02:27.601 --> 00:02:29.314
- I'm really into this, I support this.

00:02:29.314 --> 00:02:31.954
I didn't think I would, I was
a skeptic, but I'm into it.

00:02:31.954 --> 00:02:33.402
- Okay, so the reviews are in.

00:02:33.402 --> 00:02:34.542
Some people liked it a lot, some people

00:02:34.542 --> 00:02:36.106
didn't like it as much, it's really sweet,

00:02:36.106 --> 00:02:37.977
tastes like a milkshake,
tastes like a marshmallow.

00:02:37.977 --> 00:02:39.812
If you've had the Burger
King Lucky Charms milkshake

00:02:39.812 --> 00:02:41.706
let us know in the comments
below how you liked it

00:02:41.706 --> 00:02:44.091
and that's about all I
have to say about that.

00:02:44.091 --> 00:02:47.258
(funky upbeat music)

